J0AFanNeD3tHWJwyM_XjA4ByAx0kjd40t2kzagN--GH_p7lPr4jrs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwHAQXi_6BhXeGkEMFOvvWUDWJd7A1M71uy-3B5L1H2cQ&oe=69C67F58"}, {"file_name": "metafied-com.oculus.vrshell-20250909-133810.png", "id": "1781536295816998", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620309_1781536299150331_1668337338983980294_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7tHiz03kmD0Q7kNvwEKTqh7&_nc_oc=Adr-4LfVa-AoAmyYA1mB-sr7kWH3ma39BCCu_nqU9WigERie6ANno9kDXNJ3MRpw4sM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afygke1MDnOH3ZJJLs_ME7I8doDMDWvw1y_jTD4q1zHAvg&oe=69C66FC1"}, {"file_name": "metafied-com.oculus.vrshell-20250909-134434.png", "id": "24277725275244158", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303769_24277725291910823_1801811960652122137_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VdrPFWtmJGwQ7kNvwH2XUyq&_nc_oc=AdoDV2j94G2__Burt9LhERuR2FexJM91Ar14dc4mPqYnCEWGzHosHpE3gP05MsuvNGQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwVMpmUIKAT3pmEGOXd_tMIyUIRjw_8A31D-th13NpHlg&oe=69C6928C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Augmental Puzzles", "keywords": ["logic", "puzzle", "numbers", "sudoku", "calming"], "long_description": "Master complex puzzles with smart highlighting and intelligent hints.\n\nCorrect mistakes instantly using the infinite undo and replay.\n\nPuzzles crafted by hand, computer verified. Tasty Sourdough-ku!\n\nCheck solutions on the fly to help you solve them with absolute confidence!\n\n{3270784359741014}\n- **Intelligent highlighting** - Making a wrong placement highlights  it, as well as any other number that it clashes with so you can see where the problem lies! \n\n- **Hint System** - We all get stuck sometimes. With our Intelligent Help feature you can get a hint to get you going again.\n\n- **Infinite Undo** - Made a mistake? Not a problem. You can undo it to your heart\u2019s content. Replay allows you to rewatch how you solved the puzzle to learn from your journey.\n\n- **Rules validation** - Making sure you put your numbers correctly according to the sudoku rules.\n\n- **Solution checker** - Checks against the solution for this puzzle. It\u2019s non-intrusive and can be turned off if you\u2019d rather try on your own first.\n\n- **Cloud Save** - Taking a break? Come back and continue your puzzle anytime. There is never any rush with our game.\n\n\n\n# Daily challenges\n{1922426285376151}\nEvery day there is a new sudoku puzzle for you to solve.\n\n\n# Scoring leaderboards\n{4136742409975957}\nFor the competitive puzzlers among us, climb the Daily Challenge Leaderboards.\n\n\n# Handset puzzles\n{1155457683408305}\nAll of our puzzles are handset and come in different sizes!\n", "short_description": "Unwind your mind with Augmental Puzzles, a soothing Puzzle experience designed for daily play. Enjoy a fresh puzzle every day, climb the global leaderboard, and immerse yourself in the quiet satisfaction of logic and focus."}]}, "developer_name": "Flammable Penguins Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://flammablepenguins.com/augmental_puzzles/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://flammablepenguins.com/augmental_puzzles/eula.html", "publisher_name": "Flammable Penguins Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.flammablepenguins.com/augmental_puzzles/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": 